{"content":[{"c":["ER"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Eldest son of Judah and Bathshua, a Canaanite woman (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.38.3","r":"Gen.38.3","rawR":"Gen.38.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.38.3","value":"Gen.38.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 38:3"},"). The Lord killed him before he and his wife, Tamar, could have any children (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.38.7","r":"Gen.38.7","rawR":"Gen.38.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.38.7","value":"Gen.38.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 38:7"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Gen.46.12","r":"Gen.46.12","rawR":"Gen.46.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.46.12","value":"Gen.46.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"46:12"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.2.3","r":"1Chr.2.3","rawR":"1Chr.2.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.2.3","value":"1Chr.2.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 2:3"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Grandson of Judah and father of Lecah (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.4.21","r":"1Chr.4.21","rawR":"1Chr.4.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.4.21","value":"1Chr.4.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 4:21"},"); a nephew of #1 above."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Joshua’s son and an ancestor of Joseph, the husband of Mary (",{"href":"?bref=Luke.3.28","r":"Luke.3.28","rawR":"Luke.3.28","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Luke.3.28","value":"Luke.3.28"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lk 3:28"},"). ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=GenealogyofJesusChrist_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"GenealogyofJesusChrist_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"GenealogyofJesusChrist_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Genealogy of Jesus Christ"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Er","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 38:3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.38.3","rawQueryValue":"Gen.38.3","sourceRefExact":"Gen.38.3"},{"anchorText":"Gn 38:7","canonicalizat